## 3. การจอง

### ดูการจองปัจจุบัน
```sql
SELECT b.room_no, g.Guest_Name, b.check_in, b.check_out, b.nights, b.payment_channel
FROM bookings b
LEFT JOIN dim_guests g ON b.guest_id = g.Guest_ID
WHERE b.check_in >= DATE('now')
ORDER BY b.check_in, b.room_no;
```

### บันทึกการจองใหม่
```sql
INSERT INTO bookings (room_no, guest_id, check_in, check_out, nights, room_rate, service_fee, total_amount, status, payment_channel, booking_channel)
VALUES ('B106', 'CM01957', '2026-03-01', '2026-03-02', 1, 400, 0, 400, 'Active', 'โอน', 'Walk-in');
```

**คอลัมน์ bookings:** `booking_no, room_no, guest_id, check_in, check_out, nights, room_rate, service_fee, total_amount, status, payment_channel, booking_channel`

